  "input": "Which note first recorded the deploy window for auth-gateway, and when?\n[2025-01-29] standup/ember/2025-01-29: Per the change policy, auth-gateway deploys on weekdays between 08:00 and 10:00 UTC, never on Fridays. [2025-12-16] standup/ember/2025-12-16: The ledger service deploy window (unchanged): on Wednesdays between 09:00 and 11:00 UTC. [2026-04-16] standup/ember/2026-04-16: The ledger service's deploy window changes today: it is now on Mondays and Wednesdays between 14:00 and 16:00 UTC. The old slot (Wednesdays 09:00-11:00 UTC) is retired.",
